---
// Lo que nos distingue. SVGs inline simples (sin librerías).
---
<section id="nosotros" class="bg-secondary py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold text-primary sm:text-4xl">Nosotros</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-center text-text/70">
      Cocina de fuego y recetas de siempre, en el corazón de Resistencia.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <!-- Parrilla a leña -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3c1.5 2.5.5 4-1 5.5C9 10.5 8 12 8 14a4 4 0 0 0 8 0c0-1.5-.5-2.7-1.5-3.8" />
          <path d="M12 21a3 3 0 0 1-3-3c0-1.2 1-2.2 1.5-3 .8 1 1.5 1.5 1.5 3a3 3 0 0 1-3 3z" transform="translate(1.5 0)" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Parrilla a leña</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Carnes a las brasas con el sabor de siempre.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pasta artesanal -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 13h16a8 8 0 0 1-16 0z" />
          <path d="M8 10V5M11 10V4M14 10V5M17 10V6" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Pasta artesanal</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Pastas frescas amasadas todos los días.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pizza al horno de barro -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3 3 19h18L12 3z" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="11" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          <circle cx="9.5" cy="15.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          <circle cx="14" cy="15" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Pizza al horno de barro</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Masa madre y horno de barro a alta temperatura.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Ambiente familiar -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3" />
          <circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.2" />
          <path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0M14.5 19a4 4 0 0 1 6 0" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Ambiente familiar</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Un lugar cálido para disfrutar en familia.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
